#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:3
#: 52fa93cafe014821962d48ee72a02484
#
msgid "几何健全性过滤（Geometry Sanity Filter）"
msgstr "Geometry Sanity Filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:5
#: b56a3e696e664676a2872f93ed6a4a21
msgid "**分类：** 筛选与采样"
msgstr "**Category:** Filtering"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:7
#: 8f36545ad69040cdb53b613f1ad8db2d
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:9
#: cf5ad439d7f24be5a746f024cdea39f1
#
msgid ""
"按明确的几何门槛清洗候选结构，只保留全部条件都通过的帧。它通常放在结构生成或扰动之后、`FPS 代表性采样` "
"之前，避免明显异常结构进入代表性采样和 DFT。"
msgstr "Clean a candidate set using explicit geometric thresholds and retain only frames that pass every enabled condition. Place it after structure generation or perturbation and before `FPS Sampling`, so clearly invalid structures do not enter representative sampling or DFT."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:11
#: 2103a41ae48f4db3b7042bda753fd52b
msgid ""
"空结构和含 NaN/Inf 坐标的结构始终删除。其余数值填 `0` "
"表示不启用该项。界面的“精确预览”会在后台检查完整输入，并显示保留数、删除数和每帧遇到的第一个失败原因。"
msgstr ""
"Empty structures and structures containing NaN/Inf coordinates are always"
" removed. For all other numeric thresholds, enter `0` to disable the "
"check. The interface's `Exact preview` checks the complete input in the "
"background and reports retained and removed counts plus the first failure"
" reason encountered for each frame."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:13
#: f06015a2c5b14329b75c0fbdc87447db
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:15
#: f16f92ef4f5742249dac2dd0c561908e
msgid "对含 $N$ 个原子的结构，程序计算"
msgstr "For a structure containing $N$ atoms, the program computes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:17
#: 6b7e79540cf14a45a4de67e2e35324d7
msgid ""
"\n"
"d_{\\min}=\\min_{i<j}d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}},\\qquad\n"
"v_{\\mathrm{atom}}=\\frac{|\\det\\mathbf C|}{N},\\qquad\n"
"\\rho=1.66053906660\\frac{\\sum_i M_i}{|\\det\\mathbf C|}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:23
#: b738c1a10d7d45cc935401c5dc3de845
msgid "$d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$：只在启用的周期方向使用最小镜像，单位 Å；距离严格小于下限时删除，恰好等于下限时保留。"
msgstr ""
"$d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$: the minimum-image convention is applied only "
"along enabled periodic directions, in Å. A structure is removed when the "
"distance is strictly below the lower bound and retained when it equals "
"the bound."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:24
#: 4a3cad2b86f14e0d93226768c8b87a9b
msgid "$v_{\\mathrm{atom}}$：完整晶胞体积除以原子数，单位 Å³/atom。"
msgstr "$v_{\\mathrm{atom}}$: full cell volume divided by atom count, in Å³/atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:25
#: ba11a9d69534490bb1e94e22844a65aa
msgid "$\\rho$：由完整晶胞体积和原子质量 $M_i$ 得到的质量密度，单位 g/cm³。"
msgstr ""
"$\\rho$: mass density calculated from the full cell volume and atomic "
"masses $M_i$, in g/cm³."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:27
#: 3e35997a179b4b1d89a2dbbad11fae7a
msgid "体积和密度都使用整个晶胞，真空层也计入。因此 slab、界面、多孔结构或带盒子的分子只有在“完整晶胞数值”确实可比较时才适合启用这些门槛。"
msgstr ""
"Both volume and density use the entire cell, including vacuum. Therefore,"
" enable these thresholds for slabs, interfaces, porous structures, or "
"boxed molecules only when their full-cell values are genuinely "
"comparable."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:29
#: 52edeafb7691408aaf4836f87e5076cc
msgid ""
"筛选按以下顺序记录每帧的第一个失败原因：空结构 → 非有限坐标 → 无效晶胞 → 原子对过近 → 单原子体积过小/过大 → "
"密度过低/过高。正式运行与预览使用同一判定。"
msgstr ""
"The filter records the first failure reason for each frame in this order:"
" empty structure → nonfinite coordinates → invalid cell → atom pair too "
"close → per-atom volume too small/large → density too low/high. The full "
"run and preview use the same criteria."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:31
#: cc131df4c58640da902c6e9d46f9454f
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:33
#: d03acd8926fd4915bee2f951b0526684
#
msgid ""
"随机占位和强扰动后，候选池中出现少量过短原子对。先查看距离分布，再把“最小原子对距离”设为低于所有合理键长的下限，例如金属候选池可从 `1.0 "
"Å` 附近试起。预览若只删除低端离群帧，再运行筛选并接 `FPS 代表性采样`。"
msgstr "After random occupancy and strong perturbation, a candidate pool may contain a few excessively short atom pairs. Inspect the distance distribution first, then set `Minimum atom-pair distance` below every physically reasonable bond length. For a metallic candidate pool, a value near `1.0 Å` can be an initial trial. If the preview removes only low-end outlier frames, run the filter and follow it with `FPS Sampling`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:35
#: 3e01f214ab2946f78d6b4238ea9dd6a5
msgid "混合化学体系不能照搬这个示例：H–H、O–H 等合理短键可能小于金属体系阈值。若无法给所有元素对确定统一下限，就保持 `0`。"
msgstr ""
"Do not apply this example unchanged to mixed chemical systems: valid "
"short bonds such as H–H and O–H may be below a threshold suitable for "
"metals. If no single lower bound is valid for every element pair, keep "
"the value at `0`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:37
#: 388baaae940b44ce840d72bd2ccbf126
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:39
#: de63c916517a42089a4d084139b9f03d
msgid "最小原子对距离（min_pair_distance）"
msgstr "Minimum Atom-Pair Distance (min_pair_distance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:41
#: d8d771f9666f4675b74f4850ccd1955a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.5 Å`。所有元素对共用同一个距离下限；该值用于清除明显重叠，同时保留常见的 H–H 键。设为 `0` "
"可关闭。非周期分子即使没有有效晶胞，也可以单独使用这一项。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.5 Å`. All element pairs share one distance lower "
"bound. The default removes clear overlaps while retaining a typical H–H "
"bond. Set it to `0` to disable the check. This check can be used by "
"itself for a nonperiodic molecule even when no valid cell is present."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:43
#: 33620ccebeb5448eba1bc0751098d45c
msgid "最小单原子体积（min_volume_per_atom）"
msgstr "min_volume_per_atom"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:45
#: 139e52f6ff5f48058e0173029f3f7cd2
msgid "`float`，默认 `0 Å³/atom`。删除单原子体积低于该值的结构；`0` 表示关闭。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0 Å³/atom`. Removes structures whose per-atom volume is"
" below this value; `0` disables the check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:47
#: fcefdc16f84d4ba4aa23d7a320913f5e
msgid "最大单原子体积（max_volume_per_atom）"
msgstr "max_volume_per_atom"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:49
#: cadec2b470d045f58337159a82c7ee72
msgid "`float`，默认 `0 Å³/atom`。删除单原子体积高于该值的结构；`0` 表示关闭。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0 Å³/atom`. Removes structures whose per-atom volume is"
" above this value; `0` disables the check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:51
#: 66ca71e8d60d4901856c33df635cd323
msgid "最小密度（min_density）"
msgstr "min_density"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:53
#: a11c7d5005944f3b9727270c8246d633
msgid "`float`，默认 `0 g/cm³`。删除密度低于该值的结构；`0` 表示关闭。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0 g/cm³`. Removes structures whose density is below "
"this value; `0` disables the check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:55
#: f10830bf57fd4673b02a1e4071f7a569
msgid "最大密度（max_density）"
msgstr "max_density"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:57
#: 71a6b864da064e3eb00f9afd262eb89f
msgid "`float`，默认 `0 g/cm³`。删除密度高于该值的结构；`0` 表示关闭。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0 g/cm³`. Removes structures whose density is above "
"this value; `0` disables the check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:59
#: 6d4b7d1c71c64f20bab8ca47a9bd4b0b
msgid "删除无效晶胞（require_finite_cell）"
msgstr "Remove Invalid Cells (require_finite_cell)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:61
#: c3364827cc4640d98c20f917c02adf45
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后删除含 NaN/Inf、奇异或近零体积的晶胞。只要启用了任一体积或密度门槛，无效晶胞也会自动删除。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, removes cells containing NaN/Inf "
"values or having singular or near-zero volume. Invalid cells are also "
"removed automatically whenever any volume or density threshold is "
"enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:63
#: 2259585dea904ee892279d34dc8e1500
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:65
#: 2d8b183233194f9ebaa5ebc7aead8eb6
msgid "`原子扰动 → 几何健全性过滤 → FPS 代表性采样`"
msgstr "`Atomic Perturb → Geometry Sanity Filter → FPS Sampling`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:66
#: 0d5f4a51204f408c9460746ccd866254
msgid "`随机占位 → 几何健全性过滤 → FPS 代表性采样`"
msgstr "`Random Occupancy → Geometry Sanity Filter → FPS Sampling`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:68
#: 7a27d1e42f6c4bf39477cd8df3bce78c
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:70
#: 3c8100d5e6c8434ca4c1dbeff3a6f5b2
msgid "**为什么预览的各原因之和等于删除总数？** 每帧只计入第一个失败原因，不会在多个原因中重复计数。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the sum of preview reasons equal the total removed count?** "
"Each frame is counted under its first failure reason only and is not "
"duplicated across reasons."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:72
#: a7c7125d548e4e4d8693873fa661a36e
msgid "**为什么 slab 的密度很低？** 真空层属于完整晶胞体积，会降低密度并增大单原子体积。此类数据通常只开原子对距离门槛。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is a slab's density low?** Vacuum is part of the full cell volume, "
"which lowers density and raises per-atom volume. For such data, usually "
"enable only the atom-pair distance threshold."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:74
#: c9c17409dabd44ceac4e01d92208d51e
msgid "**为什么无晶胞分子仍能检查距离？** 只开原子对距离时不要求有效晶胞；周期最小镜像仅用于结构实际启用的周期方向。"
msgstr ""
"**Why can a molecule without a cell still be checked for distance?** A "
"valid cell is not required when only the atom-pair distance check is "
"enabled. Periodic minimum images are used only along directions in which "
"the structure actually enables PBC."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:76
#: 1319315273b24f7dbcfedcec9d7c6e64
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:78
#: 042dbf7cf9f14750b4e97b2709b2cadc
msgid "保留下来的结构及其 `Config_type` 不变，输入顺序也不变。"
msgstr ""
"Retained structures and their `Config_type` values remain unchanged, as "
"does the input order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:80
#: e3d93af4ec0442c7a1f6c8603deca48c
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/geometry-filter-card.md:82
#: ebdc8fbe3d8049b58a907a8c1946793c
msgid "本卡没有随机性。同一输入和同一参数会得到相同结果。"
msgstr ""
"This card has no randomness. The same input and parameters produce the "
"same result."

